Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:53.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:58.39,Title,0,0,0,0,,《圣誓》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受的苦到此为止了 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我们的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们是老乡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备 我救你们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大胡子畜生也能听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手下人挺厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是我手下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是头儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀罗马人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,光想想我就兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这条破船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.92,0:11:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 让我们互相拥抱 互称兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.47,0:11:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该举杯庆祝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好不过了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:12:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛杜鲁斯清醒时是猛兽 喝醉了就是傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小纳美特斯人说得太他妈对了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.72,0:33:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟娘们温存的时候 我们正忙着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他们能懂的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.55,0:34:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备开伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.64,0:34:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些傻逼们瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.45,0:34:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫抽插自如
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.13,0:39:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯掉他的鸡巴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.34,0:39:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝了酒 简直跟赛杜鲁斯一样野蛮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.45,0:39:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不输给男人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论哪方面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.70,0:40:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来玩玩吧 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.19,0:44:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚怎能只喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.19,0:45:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子要日破你这张漂亮的小脸蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.26,0:45:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛杜鲁斯 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲为了我的大好前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father dissolves our marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除了我们的婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}in favor of more promising opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.35,0:00:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间什么都没有了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there nothing left between us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有回忆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Memories only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场已被烧为灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arena is burned to fucking ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺带着送了不少罗马人上西天\N{\fnArial\fs30}With many Romans among the ashes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can he be healed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的伤势恐怕无力回天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man is beyond what would warrant life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是奥诺玛默斯 可不是寻常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Oenomaus and he is more than common man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,又在竞技场里找到一百来具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred more bodies pulled from the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,废墟里还有这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was found in the wreckage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神如此惩罚我 让我的父亲死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have punished me by striking down my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样还不够 - 盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is not enough. - Gaius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你腹中的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you have not joined your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就去九泉下和你父亲团聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the child that grows within you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,打杂的奴隶不可能成为角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}House slaves will never be gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们缺的正是能打仗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need fighting men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许该重新考虑那不勒斯的计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it is time to revisit plans towards Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是运送战俘的奴隶商船\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its slaver ships from foreign wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要攻打港口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would attack the port?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的真讨厌这鬼天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not care for the fucking rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.85,0:01:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,更讨厌有人三更半夜打搅我休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor disturbance at unreasonable hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快让你忘掉这些烦心事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you quickly removed from such concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以付一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And well compensated for allowing eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是看看你的货\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon your latest offerings, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想等到拍卖会\N{\fnArial\fs30}in advance of auction…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么晚了还冒雨过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have pressing need, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你有急事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to venture out on such a night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是等天亮恐怕就来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the rising sun would dash hopes of it being met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.38,0:01:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要得急 价格就高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short of time, long of coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么样的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}What form of slave narrows your purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能打仗的最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a desire towards fighting men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, gladiators!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马的很多冠军都是我送去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've supplied Rome with many of its' finest champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜卡普亚的竞技场不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly with the arena in Capua gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些奴隶的需求也一落千丈\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's less interest in these men of such talents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunate for my cause then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有我中意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see how you can further aid it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅这股臭味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive the stench.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱茵河东岸的这帮蛮子就喜欢屎尿味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Savages east of the Rhine tend to favor their own shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想先把他们擦擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intended to have them scraped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹点油 再送去拍卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and oiled before auction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过估计也于事无补\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I feared that would do little to improve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们天生这么臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}their natural odor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些女人怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you find the women?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟男的一个德行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As unpleasant as their men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我劝你还是别操她们为好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not recommend lustful hand placed upon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙拿来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys, quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们那里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You not from our lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也被罗马人的锁链捆过 跟你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I was once bound in chains by the Romans, as you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会轻易放过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grievance I would see them pay dearly for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他们愿意跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says they are with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是幸运啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fortunate thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一船人都是你的老乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we liberate a ship filled with your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诸神保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods favor us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer will we have to listen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那帮高卢人的眼色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to those fucking Gauls again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geht Bruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙卡图对你是赞赏有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Mercato spoke highly of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他再也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}A grave misfortune that his tongue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,开口说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has forevebeen silenced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是因为他的逝去 我才会到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}His passing cause for my presence before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,逝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这词儿根本无法体现他死得有多惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too gentle a word for how he was ushered from this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想逃离斯巴达克斯的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood and brains staining the pulvinus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果脑子肠子流了一地\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he thought to flee Spartacus' wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的怒火殃及了很多无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing that threatens to consume many innocent lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还以为你也死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had thought you were mangled corpse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋在支离破碎的竞技场废墟里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sundered beams of the arena your tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天发生的事让我有点精神恍惚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The events of the day caused me absent proper mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has since returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也回到城里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you to our streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 蒙卡图是我的雇主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercato my purpose, as I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去竞技场帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is the matter of coin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.61,0:05:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没拿到报酬呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}for services tended upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是干掉那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were secured to execute those shits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.69,0:05:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,追随斯巴达克斯的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}that follow Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是你一个人也没杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not recall any falling to your sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是斯巴达克斯没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}had Spartacus not appeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你要的报酬也就能兑现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And coin would have materialized the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,木已成舟 我也无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the past cannot be altered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在缺钱 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am without coin, Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我也不会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have returned otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在你多年在竞技场娱乐大家的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your years of pleasing the crowd in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请跟那伟大的竞技场一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now follow once noble monument, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.05,0:05:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我面前消失吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and collapse from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magistrate? Apologies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场坍塌时 我的鲁迪斯也不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}my rudis was lost when the arena fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有它… - 不要得寸进尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Without it… - You press beyond reason!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄运已经降临卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll winds has blown Capua{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏了这里的正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}from once steady course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事就去找民政官葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take further matter to Praetor Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他心情好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you can entice coin from him as well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赏你几个钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}if caught upon proper mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都失去了至爱的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have all suffered loss of those closest to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我们伟大共和国的元老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even a senator of our great Republic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man my wife called father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不幸丧命在\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been ripped from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯那帮杂种的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Spartacus and his mongrel hordes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我们敬爱的赛普修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now beloved Seppius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也在这场叛乱中离我们而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}has fallen to this festering disease of rebellion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的奴隶杀害了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murdered by his own slaves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,并偷偷逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}who even now spirited themselves away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:07:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入斯巴达克斯的叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}to join Spartacus against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,危难关头 我们必须提高警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must be ever vigilant in these dark times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不放过任何可疑迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must bring to light even dimmest shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,及早扼杀叛乱的苗头\N{\fnArial\fs30}of betrayal if it is revealed to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今往后\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this day forward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何敢提到斯巴达克斯这个名字的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}any slave who dares to whisper the name Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,都要被处以极刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be put to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even those{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马民政官的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}owned by a praetor of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dominus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟他对着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not speak against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听她是如何求饶的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen how she begs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天她这张嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleading with the very tongue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在歌颂斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that only yesterday had praise for Spartacus upon it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌颂那些杀掉赛普修斯的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise for the slaves that murdered Seppius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏我忠诚的妻子无意间听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise most fortunate to be overheard by loyal wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到她说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear her speak it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀她一次根本不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that she had more than one life to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就以此警告所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let this serve as warning to any slave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,密谋叛乱的奴隶们\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would conspire against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:09:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才的打法太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a foolish attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想直接砍掉对方的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seek to part head from shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实杀人有很多简单的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are blows that kill with less effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就要学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall learn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不愿离开她一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is never from her side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯要他去那不勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus wanted him towards Neapolis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他执意要陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he would not leave her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许让他和艾力冈分开才是最好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though perhaps it's best to keep him and Agron parted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅好幸运 有人这么爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia is blessed to be loved so deeply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是 斯巴达克斯深爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are you, by Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前教你攻不忘守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taught you never to lower guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要这样教妮维雅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now see Naevia to same instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为再也见不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you for the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们都受了很重的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet we did not escaped deep wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让罗马人千倍奉还\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing to be visited upon the Romans a thousand fold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是奥诺玛默斯来到我们这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that Oenomaus stands with us once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时太傻 没有跟你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a fool to be gone so long from your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.58,0:11:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such things are of the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们展望未来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us turn thought towards future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看未来有多美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what joys it may hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完成了不可能完成的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,队伍扩大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ranks swell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.55,0:12:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need more weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个问题一定要解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}A concern that must be addressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense a deeper one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是艾力冈的族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all fucking Agron's people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.87,0:12:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅一天我们的人就多了一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our forces have doubled in a single day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.03,0:12:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且都是能打能杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With people who are no stranger to battle and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who will they follow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这次发现你的屁股稍稍动了动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I detected a hint of movement in your hips this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抽插的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}A subtle thrust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迎合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I bore down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始喜欢我操你的感觉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You begin to enjoy my cock inside of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.39,0:13:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁听过如此美妙的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has a man ever heard so sweet a sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your voice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的爱抚\N{\fnArial\fs30}your touch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,热乎乎的大腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}the warmth of your thighs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪昆图斯拜倒在你的裙下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a wonder Quintus fell beneath your spell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无保留地宠爱你 送你东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lavishing you with affection and gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在改叫我主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me dominus now, in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:14:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报 我要送你一件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only just that I present you with something in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里弄来这么多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by such bounty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人白送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were freely given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人不需要这些东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the dead who no longer have need for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这个箱子装满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this chest is full, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将见证我阿舒尔更上一层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's worth shall see Ashur to even greater heights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}for one such as you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拿钱买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}something purchased with coin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道昆图斯痴迷于发色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how fond Quintus was of the color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you wear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看着你站在阳台上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I may look up to you upon the balcony…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道你是我的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and know that you are mine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你心如刀割\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart has been deeply wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有什么能安抚你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is anything to offer as balm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need but voice it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.48,0:15:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的人由你指挥了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take command of his men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.44,0:15:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他当初同意跟你合作就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that he had given them freely in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.21,0:15:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没有斯巴达克斯什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus would be a distant memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my brother yet by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only it had been so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father would yet grace this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的奴隶也不会因此被钉死在十字架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my slave would have had no cause to be crucified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥的手下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's men arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起检阅他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us review them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:16:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们发誓效忠于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bind them to cause with oath of loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,站好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tongue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁代表你们发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stands forth as your voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔维斯•塔苏斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octavius Tarsus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表他们发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的雇主被暴徒斯巴达克斯夺去了性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your benefactor has been ripped from this world by the villain Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于他已过世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards his end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我征召你及你的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I conscript you and your men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,到盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博麾下\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the army of Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,宣读圣誓 效忠于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recite the Sacramentum, and commit loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 奥克塔维斯•塔苏斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Octavius Tarsus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以神圣而伟大的朱庇特之名发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}swear by Jupiter Optimus Maximus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等当维护并捍卫共和国和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I shall uphold and defend the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的敌人就是我等的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to have her enemies as my enemies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的朋友亦是我等的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and her friends as my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换回以前的发色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've taken to your old color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.37,0:17:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉不适合就换了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear it no longer suits me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切言行举止都为了她的荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}… her honor in all my thoughts, words, and actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓将身体和生命献给共和国及其军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pledge my body and life to the Republic and to its army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受民政官盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the leadership of Praetor Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,人够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will they be enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上我的军队 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Added to my own troops, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够将斯巴达克斯绳之以法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be enough to bring Spartacus to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要他伏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not seek justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是要复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么杀我哥哥 我就要他怎么死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who took the life of my brother must die the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}In blood and slaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,以神圣而伟大的朱庇特之名 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Jupiter Optimus Maximus, I so swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,以神圣而伟大的朱庇特之名 我们发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Jupiter Optimus Maximus, we so swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去外面扎营吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set camp outside these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们由萨尔维斯指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvius will see you to orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且干掉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the death of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的一片心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for your kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是特别珍惜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I have treasured it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你以后住在这里比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it would be best if you made home here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath our roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算明早就去我在庞贝的叔叔家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave in the morning for my uncle's villa in Pompeii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不允许你在斯巴达叛党\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have you upon the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍阴魂不散时冒险出行\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the threat of Spartacus still remains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你叔叔捎个口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will send word to your uncle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对我的提议还满意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you find solace in the thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常欢迎你的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence offers great comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,能和你们同住是我的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am blessed to find myself among you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你安排一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us make arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.78,0:19:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在不久前 我还以为他懦弱无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it so recent that I thought him weak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我每次看他的眼睛就不寒而栗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now gaze into his eyes and tremble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他眼里藏着可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}at what lurks behind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千万不要沉浸在这种情绪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not work yourself into an unfortunate state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我活着的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the only reason I yet live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.90,0:19:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本取悦不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I do pleases him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了先前的事情惩罚我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tortures me for what I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴莎拉受了刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thessala crucified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又邀请赛皮娅进家住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppia invited into our house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看她的那种眼神…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he looks at her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只能是这样的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see myself over cliff, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿跳下悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this is all fate now holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的心就全碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart would follow to the rocks below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这样活下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot live like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一点肉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of our meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都忘了我的族人有多大胃口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot how much my kin devour upon a sitting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近你好像忘了不少事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much seems to have slipped mind of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派我去那不勒斯侦查\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent me to scout Neapolis{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告港口的动向\N{\fnArial\fs30}and report on opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以搞定了那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their ship provided it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时还有没有别的船只呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there any others that may have afforded the same?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.89,0:20:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两艘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘来自大马士革\N{\fnArial\fs30}One from Damascus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一艘来自高卢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other Gaullia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些情况你应该告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}News I would have cared to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大马士革的人都不中用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men from Damascus are of low quality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even lower trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.98,0:20:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那高卢人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Gaullia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望身边充斥着高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have these ranks filled with Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克雷斯… - 是值得尊敬的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crixus - Is an honorable man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早我带你那些兄弟们去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take your brothers to hunt when day breaks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,补充食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to replenish supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便考察我们是否合得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gauge how we might come together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.19,0:21:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们能说通用语就说通用语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell those who are able to speak in common tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们都能知道他们的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all among us may know their thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定大有作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will prove great asset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然想吃霸王餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那些在竞技场倒塌时死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carried to the afterlife with all the others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起上了黄泉路\N{\fnArial\fs30}that fell beneath the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I yet breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我的钱袋是完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My purse however has suffered fatal blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没钱让你张开大腿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no coin to pry open thighs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我愿意 不出钱也行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may yet widen, of their own accord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不赚钱的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}A miracle lacking profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你主人很少做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you and your master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得当时受奴役的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall what it was like to have one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在获得自由之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you gained your freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.09,0:22:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人是真正自由的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man is ever truly free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,和追随他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those who follow him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他攻打竞技场的时候你看见他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see him when he attacked the arena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.07,0:22:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What form of man was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.64,0:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of dangerous things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.87,0:22:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光我谈论他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很多人都在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's talk among many of us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.36,0:22:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能跟他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards joining his cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么前途呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cause…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无非就是带领一帮无辜的傻瓜送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the leading of innocent fools to their death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.12,0:22:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有钱是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no coin then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有离开这个破地方的盘缠钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few denarii for passage away from this fucking city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想斯巴达克斯的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike Spartacus from your thoughts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.99,0:23:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come with me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.78,0:23:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是强大的甘尼克斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is joyous occasion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人喜出望外呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find you yet alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.89,0:23:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,膝上还有美女相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}With ripe offering perched upon lap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.77,0:23:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,打搅男欢女爱之事实在不妥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is unforgivable to come between man and cunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我必须跟我兄弟说几句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I must have words with my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个可人的尤物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}An enticing creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你从不缺女人投怀送抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you never lacked the attention of fine women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.74,0:23:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话快说 有屁快放\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you seek words, break them and be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年了 你嘴巴还是不太干净啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The years have not seen you to better manners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.93,0:23:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同伴还是这种货色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor you to better company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.63,0:23:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would advise caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人现在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men are the hand of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博的左膀右臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.03,0:24:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的老屌还是屁眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cock or his ass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.22,0:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am his will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.46,0:24:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实就是负责治安嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bound by duty to restore order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.25,0:24:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把小姑娘钉在十字架上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By nailing little girls to the cross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.05,0:24:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何谈及斯巴达克斯及其叛乱的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any slaves who whispers of Spartacus and his rebellion…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,都跟那姑娘一个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall find place beside her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对这些言论没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no interest in whispers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对民政官的意志也没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor the will of your praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.02,0:24:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胆狂言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bold words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于奴隶而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.11,0:24:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.69,0:24:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是自由人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.78,0:24:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 你华丽变身为竞技场之神时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I was there upon the sands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在沙场上亲眼目睹那一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you became a god of the arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.29,0:24:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场面让人永生难忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a sight never to be forgotten!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯 在开幕式的骁将之战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus, besting twenty gladiators{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.95,0:25:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,击败了二十名角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the primus of the opening day!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.51,0:25:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而奖赏呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是鲁迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rudis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.07,0:25:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把刻着他辉煌胜利的木剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wooden sword carved with the legend of his victories!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.61,0:25:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由的证明 顺应万众的呼声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proof of freedom, demanded by adoring crowd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们瞧瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说他们肯定非常期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sure they would be eager{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.64,0:25:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一睹这稀罕宝贝的风采\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lay eyes upon such rare marval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不给看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.83,0:25:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没带在身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not have it upon you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知故问\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.55,0:25:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同我知道民政官会非常乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I know the praetor will be most pleased{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.47,0:25:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你鞍前马后地效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the presence of your company…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.61,0:25:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很惊讶地发现你还活在这世界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find it surprising that you are still of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过更惊讶的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}More so that you did not think it wise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拖到这么晚才现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}to present yourself at sooner convenience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.50,0:26:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.62,0:26:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯总是惜字如金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus has always been a man of few words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.48,0:26:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他喜欢和行政官大人长篇大论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he favor the Magistrate with whole sentences, I'm told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.52,0:26:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过想完成交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought only to conclude business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的定位太低了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You aim too low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.01,0:26:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯把整个竞技场砸在你头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus brings the arena down upon you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却站在这里毫发无伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet here you stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.99,0:26:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同凤凰浴火重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A phoenix risen from its ashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.72,0:26:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确有诸神庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have truly blessed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.90,0:26:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今他的现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}As they now bless me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诸神对我的庇佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.00,0:26:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你走上竞技场时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was moved by the reaction of the crowd, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.18,0:26:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众的反应真让我震惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you stepped upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.31,0:26:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们声嘶力竭地喊出你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The swell of their voices, heralding your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.24,0:26:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了期待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filling the air with hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.68,0:26:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使那场灾难造成了破损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even tarnished by blood and calamity, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的价值仍然存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a thing yet can hold value…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.26,0:27:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鲁迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your rudis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.65,0:27:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我拿什么换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its price?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.44,0:27:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一句简单的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今以后听从我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edging yourself to my command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.33,0:27:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅曾经也是斯巴达克斯的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia was also once thought victim of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今是用来安抚情绪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet now stands a powerful symbol, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,强有力的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}used to calm spreading concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.17,0:27:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你跟她一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would add you as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.65,0:27:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个曾属于巴蒂塔斯家的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}A former slave of the House of Batiatus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.24,0:27:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,发誓要将叛逃的兄弟绳之于法\N{\fnArial\fs30}now sworn to bring errant brothers to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.05,0:27:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的人似乎有一个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears you already have one of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.34,0:27:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔擅长见不得光的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur's talents are of the shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.31,0:27:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你正大光明地登场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would present you in glorious light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.81,0:27:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在我的军队前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the front of my troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.26,0:27:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让民众再度热血沸腾地呼喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the roar of the crowd once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我对这种事情没兴趣了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I no longer crave for such a clamor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.53,0:28:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.53,0:28:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命运由你自己掌握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fate is your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.86,0:28:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天后我会再度邀请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will send for you again in a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.44,0:28:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望到时你能做出正确的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And expect reasonable decision to accompany you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.81,0:28:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 民政官大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Praetor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯并不可信\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Gannicus cannot be trusted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.10,0:28:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初对你的评价也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same once said of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.83,0:28:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你照样站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet here you stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.99,0:28:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人跟着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}See one of your men to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.56,0:28:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是甘尼克斯意图离开卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Gannicus attempts to leave Capua, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.49,0:29:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把他钉死\N{\fnArial\fs30}crucify him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.60,0:30:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no other way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.70,0:30:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对盖尤斯的看法是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right about Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.80,0:30:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是那个只敢偷偷窥探的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man he was no longer peers from behind his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.05,0:30:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会为言语或者柔情所动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not bewayed by words or gentle touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要逃脱只能付出血的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only blood can set us free now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.09,0:30:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.17,0:30:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,长痛不如短痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will hurt but for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.17,0:30:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把裙子掀起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lift your dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.90,0:30:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neapolis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘运送奴隶的船遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slaver ship was set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面载着从莱茵河东岸抓来的俘虏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It carried prisoners captured east of the Rhine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.68,0:31:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.97,0:31:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为斯巴达克斯的帮凶\N{\fnArial\fs30}To aid Spartacus' cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}An obvious conclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.24,0:31:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,派遣军队去那不勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatch men to Neapolis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.89,0:31:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,询问有没有人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question anyone who may have seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.35,0:31:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们获救后逃向何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they were headed after liberation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.56,0:31:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.50,0:31:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.81,0:31:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去找医师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch the medicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.05,0:31:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.36,0:31:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.50,0:31:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.05,0:31:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,奄奄一息的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a sign from the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.40,0:31:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来了诸神的警示\N{\fnArial\fs30}One carried by the child yet to breath life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.98,0:31:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,警示什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And its meaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.03,0:31:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再留在这座满是鲜血和恐惧的城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heir will die if it remains in a city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.57,0:31:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的继承人就会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}cursed with blood and fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她恢复我就送她去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have her carried to Rome as soon as she's able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.33,0:31:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我过去之前 由我的贴身侍卫照看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}With trusted guard to watch over her at all times, until my return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.79,0:31:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该同去 这样可以照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall accompany her and tend to her needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.24,0:32:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我插句话 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.54,0:32:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅是夫人的闺蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia's a dear friend to your wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.05,0:32:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可也是卡普亚的定心丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet offers greater comfort to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.02,0:32:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她不能现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the people will fall to despair, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕民众就绝望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent her divine presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.10,0:32:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wise counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.32,0:32:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你照例到集市去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your presence known tomorrow in the market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.22,0:32:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安抚民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease mind of our city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.87,0:32:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们相信诸神站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and continue to assure them the gods favor my efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.76,0:32:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在训练那些获救的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been training those freed of bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.21,0:32:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们没人当过教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet none among us ever held title of Doctore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.76,0:32:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对战争和战士一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no knowledge of soldiers and war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只懂训练角斗士的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know only the ways of a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.76,0:32:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受角斗训练的军队最强大不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can think of no fiercer army, so instructed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.51,0:33:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们上一堂课 开开他们的眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open their eyes as man can do giving a course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.01,0:33:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你开了我的眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you have opened mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.69,0:33:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和艾力冈他们去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hunt with Agron and his people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.58,0:33:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好考察他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}to better gauge them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.55,0:33:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来后我就帮你的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will lend aid when I return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.61,0:33:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你要一个人打猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you hunt alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.53,0:33:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天没亮艾力冈就带着那些人走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron left with the others before light broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.67,0:33:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明知道我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hunt without me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.02,0:33:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然没叫我就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you knew my intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.44,0:33:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一大早就醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They woke before the sun, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.66,0:33:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待地要享受自由生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and were eager to take advantage of freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.84,0:33:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.05,0:33:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.89,0:33:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有罗马人的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Roman drink!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.33,0:34:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不知道树林里还能找到酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know these forests were stocked with such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.72,0:34:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么找到这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you come by this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.09,0:34:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是路上的一辆马车…\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wagon along the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.74,0:34:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离我们这么近的地方 连武器都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You attacked the road so close to our position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.43,0:34:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就贸然出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent proper weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.55,0:34:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.82,0:34:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全杀光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.56,0:34:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真后悔冒着生命危险救了这帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I risked my life for this lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.20,0:34:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们增强了我们的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see us to prope force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.76,0:34:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给我们增加了暴露的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see us to nothing but discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.69,0:34:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让罗马人放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the Romans come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.46,0:34:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再做缩头乌龟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of hiding like frightened bbits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.40,0:34:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有能力对抗正面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not ready for a direct assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.85,0:34:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子都看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something even a child could see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.31,0:34:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是小孩还把你从竞技场救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This child helped save you from the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.02,0:34:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,给大家带来了这么多战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fills our numbers with warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.21,0:34:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小畜生屁都没带来 只引来一群疯狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pup has found himself nothing but a pack of wild dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正绝对不会追随一个该死的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ones that will never follow a fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.05,0:35:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉没叫你就出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies for leaving without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.91,0:35:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑这孩子没什么诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question that boy's sincerity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.63,0:35:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟新来的弟兄一起吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us break meal with our new brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.40,0:35:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看能不能解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And attempt to settle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.84,0:35:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.57,0:35:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.23,0:35:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很多人都在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's talk among many of us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能跟他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards joining his cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.52,0:36:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.12,0:36:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}A foolish girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.80,0:36:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该说的话还那么大声地讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who spoke too loudly of things she should not have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里到处都有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city is filled with ears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,竖着耳朵偷听叛逆的言论\N{\fnArial\fs30}straining for whispers of betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.13,0:36:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样有人在暗地监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is filled with eyes as well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.83,0:36:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是打算出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempt to leave the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.02,0:36:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你的朋友一个下场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and share a cross beside your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.04,0:36:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想拿这种话威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will not bow to your threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:36:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor would I see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.86,0:37:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,打什么谜语呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oracle of fucking riddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话就直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to plain words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.92,0:37:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在葛雷博面前时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something in your eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.83,0:37:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看透了你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you stood before Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.30,0:37:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不光是在权衡他的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something beyond a man weighing decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.77,0:37:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神赐予了你读心的能力了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods bless you with gift to see into my thoughts now, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.46,0:37:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她这样的人只会更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like her will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.41,0:37:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有罪无罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guilty. The innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.43,0:37:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹在葛雷博的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will stand no difference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.77,0:37:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的复仇中间 根本没有区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}when caught between Glaber's wrath and Spartacus' vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.86,0:37:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.63,0:37:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take up offer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.30,0:37:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀戮我曾经的兄弟们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn on those that I once called brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.56,0:37:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.64,0:37:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你干掉盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you end the life of Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.27,0:37:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一心想取斯巴达克斯的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is desperate to claim Spartacus' life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.32,0:38:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果走火入魔 如今比色雷斯人还要危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So consumed, that he now stands more threat than the Thracian himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.01,0:38:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他又能怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what difference would it make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马很快就会派人来接替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome would only send another to take his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.50,0:38:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是要葛雷博为他妻子的死负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus blames Glaber for part in his wife's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.29,0:38:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要葛雷博一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove him from the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.08,0:38:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,血债就还清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the scales of blood will be balanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.30,0:38:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯就会离开罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus will drift from Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.33,0:38:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论哪边都不会再有人丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more lives will be lost. On either side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.31,0:38:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber's own wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.86,0:38:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就要前往罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}this very night leaves for Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.34,0:38:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了护送她 葛雷博派出了一半的贴身侍卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking with her half his personal guard to see her safely from the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.63,0:38:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于看守宅子的那些守卫 我可以引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could distract any that remain posted to the villa entry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.34,0:38:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你就趁虚而入\N{\fnArial\fs30}giving opportunity for a single man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.08,0:38:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在葛雷博睡觉时取他性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take Glabe's life while he sleeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.30,0:38:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,由斯巴达克斯来背黑锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Spartacus to receive the blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.37,0:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have lost mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.64,0:38:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界都乱成什么样儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world has slipped from reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.46,0:38:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想恢复原样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek only to restore it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开阿舒尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rid yourself of Ashur's man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.43,0:39:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到月上梢头 我自会为你扫清障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}When moon stands highest I will see path cleared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.27,0:39:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choose to set upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.43,0:39:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则无数人都要为此遭罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or see legions fall to pointless suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.65,0:40:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的族人真是给劲儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people, they lift spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all are so moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿他们同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they'll kill each other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才值得庆祝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give proper cause for celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.83,0:40:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an impossible man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.66,0:40:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something thing you've always known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.47,0:40:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁只眼闭只眼算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And chose to ignore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.48,0:40:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要总盯着人家的缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}To better see the man beneath his faults…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.00,0:41:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起唱 黑哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing with me, my dark brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.91,0:41:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩玩我的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Share my woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.22,0:41:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不懂你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know not your words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢戈教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lugo will teach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.73,0:41:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯下不来台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus finds himself assaulted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.15,0:41:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们太喜欢闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are a boisterous people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.66,0:41:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候还是要喝点酒 犯点傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes wine and foolishness are needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,增进感情嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To forge stronger bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.79,0:41:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我唱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.40,0:41:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now is not the time for such things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.53,0:41:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有这种时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it ever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.83,0:42:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.01,0:42:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找卢戈要杯酒来喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will try and wrest a drink from Lugo for us to share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.26,0:42:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便帮奥诺玛默斯解围\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the act, aid Oenomaus in escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.84,0:42:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说服他同意你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to convince him to let you come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.56,0:42:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他就是不肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not be moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.71,0:42:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a thing of no matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.20,0:42:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我所做的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have done for me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.74,0:42:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我们永远不要分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that we were never parted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.01,0:43:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再次回到你身边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall find me again to your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.93,0:43:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想象的还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.86,0:43:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说服甘尼克斯来除掉盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sway Gannicus to forever remove Gaius from concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.43,0:43:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他完事 我就大喊大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it is done I will raise clamor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.98,0:43:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保甘尼克斯有来无回\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see Gannicus follow to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.00,0:43:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.99,0:43:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.05,0:43:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.58,0:44:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall be missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.28,0:44:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.65,0:44:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 但是克雷斯在等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude, but Crixus awaits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.81,0:44:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢人 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gaul, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.85,0:44:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.25,0:44:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}At me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.32,0:45:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没好感\N{\fnArial\fs30}No love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.23,0:45:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.21,0:45:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.92,0:45:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会转告他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.18,0:45:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 我不喜欢他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him his eyes I not like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.90,0:45:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes better…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.94,0:45:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.06,0:46:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.80,0:46:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛杜鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedullus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.36,0:46:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛杜鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedullus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.59,0:47:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.76,0:47:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.63,0:48:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.30,0:48:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.96,0:48:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.62,0:48:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,宰了你们才高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}demanding slaughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.09,0:48:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给了你们自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give you freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.87,0:48:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就干出这种无耻的事情来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you repay it with blood and dishonor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.25,0:48:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不能真心诚意地当我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can not stand among us as trusted brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.86,0:48:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不遵守我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can not follow my orders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.67,0:48:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}take leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.12,0:48:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则跟赛杜鲁斯一个下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or join Sedullus in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.63,0:49:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟从斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I follow Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.60,0:49:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意的人 我绝不拿他当族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call no man my kin that does not stand so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.86,0:49:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉赛杜鲁斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man that kills Sedullus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.50,0:49:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇不可挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}is great warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.80,0:49:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢戈跟定你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lugo follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.50,0:53:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,民政官 有急事报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor, pressing concer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.31,0:55:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯已经做出决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus has made his decision.{\r}
